{
  "abstract": "For any decidable abelian group, two four-point finite supports with one common point and identical full labelled ordered squares exist exactly when Z/4Z × Z/4Z embeds additively. The ambient group need not be cyclic or finite. No novelty assessment or independent human review is asserted.",
